@startuml FilmLab_Admin_Reporting
title Administration and Reporting Use Cases
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle stickman
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F4F7F5
  BorderColor #2D6B65
  ArrowColor #33464B
}

actor Admin
actor "Lab Owner" as LabOwner

rectangle "Film Lab Ecosystem - Administration and Reports" {
  usecase "View Admin Overview" as UC_Overview
  usecase "View Global Orders" as UC_GlobalOrders
  usecase "View Lab Dashboard" as UC_LabDashboard
  usecase "View Lab Orders" as UC_LabOrders
  usecase "View Customers and Order History" as UC_Customers
  usecase "View Operational Reports" as UC_Reports
  usecase "Select Report Period\n(daily / monthly)" as UC_Period
  usecase "Aggregate Revenue and Order Count" as UC_Aggregate
}

Admin --> UC_Overview
Admin --> UC_GlobalOrders
Admin --> UC_LabDashboard
Admin --> UC_LabOrders
Admin --> UC_Customers
Admin --> UC_Reports
LabOwner --> UC_LabDashboard
LabOwner --> UC_LabOrders
LabOwner --> UC_Customers
LabOwner --> UC_Reports

UC_Reports ..> UC_Period : <<include>>
UC_Reports ..> UC_Aggregate : <<include>>

note right of UC_Reports
  Route lab-management/reports có
  tổng doanh thu và số đơn theo ngày
  hoặc tháng. Lab owner chỉ xem dữ liệu
  thuộc lab của mình; admin xem tổng hợp.
end note

note bottom of UC_Overview
  Admin endpoints hiện có overview
  và orders. Quản lý user, moderation,
  audit log, export và analytics nâng cao
  chưa thể hiện đầy đủ trong API.
end note

@enduml